		{
			"id":"9ddeb42d20509bfa",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Info\n\nAmong the rooms we know that might have levers we have:\n\n- [[Greenhouse.canvas|Greenhouse]] (South Door) - Needs Broken Lever\n- [[Inner Sanctum.canvas|Inner Sanctum]] (North Door - Leads to [[046 - Room 46.canvas|046 - Room 46]])\n- [[Secret Garden.canvas|Secret Garden]] (East and West Doors) - Needs Secret Garden Key\n- [[Weight Room.canvas|Weight Room]] - (South Door) - You can break the wall on the Weight Room to reveal the Antechamber South Lever.\n- [[Great Hall.canvas|Great Hall]] - (East Door) - In one of the 6 Doors on the sides.\n- [[Throne Room.canvas|Throne Room]] - (North Door - Leads to [[046 - Room 46.canvas|046 - Room 46]])",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-680,
			"y":-420,
			"width":660,
			"height":340
		}
